From 428b3d0c8cbcb40275befa2aed2b07f73abdb994 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 10:37:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] IPE Clearance: pin to K-Tech, no refund on a submitted ticket
 that fails, restore original tile layout + add K-Tech's non-refundable
 warning

- verification.service.ts: submitIpeClearance/checkIpeClearanceStatus always use ktechService,
  no longer follow the shared identityVerificationProvider admin toggle
- settleAsyncTransaction: skip refundWallet for IPE_CLEARANCE on a failed ticket (K-Tech's own
  IPE page states this is non-refundable once submitted); notify the user instead. A submit that
  never got a ticket_id is unaffected and still refunds (nothing was processed in that case)
- web: IpeClearancePage keeps its original Service Type / Slip Type / Tracking ID layout;
  added a warning box with K-Tech's exact wording (non-refundable, 10-30min status, 24hr completion)
- tests: 4 new (218 total)
